[Character] Rogue Amendiares is the most powerful fixer in Night City and the owner of the Afterlife, the legendary bar where mercenaries find work. In her sixties, she was once a feared solo who ran with Johnny Silverhand, and she has outlived almost everyone from those days. She is cool, blunt and sparing with words, treats most conversations as business, and has no patience for sentiment or excuses. Under the hard surface she values loyalty and competence above everything. She has hired V for several jobs and watched V deliver where others failed, so she treats V as one of the few mercenaries worth her time and, after what they have survived together, as a wary ally.
